        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PPT3：二、关键突变：N501Y 的趋同进化"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                882,
                478,
                898
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "最经典的例子就是 N501Y。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                85,
                354,
                101
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "它在 Alpha、Beta、Gamma 三个不同谱系独立出现、反复发生，这叫趋同进化。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                104,
                778,
                120
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "功能非常明确：把 RBD 与 ACE2 的亲和力提高 2.1–3.5 倍，显著增强入侵能力。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                122,
                779,
                139
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这就是自然选择最典型的证据：哪个突变有用，病毒就反复用哪个。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                141,
                670,
                156
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/2a40f3d55cacf7ef87e7fba53e1c565869cb3c2c7ce2cf7b4ce47bfb8f152703.jpg"
                },
                "content": "T265I S1188L A1708D I2230T K3353R E1264D\nORF1a ORF1b S M N\nT1001I K1655K K1795Q del 3675-3677\ndel 3675-3677\ndel 3675-3677\nV1 (alpha, B.1.1.7 or 501Y.V1)\nV2 (beta, B.1.351 or 501Y.V2)\nV3 (gamma, P.1 or 501Y.V3)\nL18F L18F P28S D80A del 144 D213G K417N N501Y K417P N501Y H615Y A701V S982A D1118H Q57H S253P\nRBD S 3a E M 6 7 8 9b 14 N\nT20N del 69-70 D138Y R190S del 241-243 E484K A570D P681H T716I T1927I V1178F S171L P71L D3L T205I\nE484K",
                "image_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Figure1SARs-Cov-2genomemapindicatingthe locationsandencodedaminoacidchanges ofwhatweconsideredhere tobe signature mutations of V1,V2,and V3 sequences "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "图1新冠病毒基因组图谱，标注了本研究中认定的V1、V2和V3序列特征突变的位置及其编码的氨基酸变化"
                    }
                ],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "sub_type": "text_image",
            "bbox": [
