            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PPT4：三、Omicron：从 “更强结合” 转向 “更强逃逸”"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                456,
                571,
                470
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "到了 Omicron，点突变策略发生关键转变："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                475,
                478,
                489
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "不再一味追求更高 ACE2 亲和力，而是在维持结合的同时，优先选免疫逃逸突变。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                493,
                779,
                508
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "比如："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                512,
                193,
                526
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "content": {
                "list_type": "text_list",
                "list_items": [
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": ". K417N "
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "E484A "
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "item_type": "text",
                        "item_content": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "content": "Q493R "
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                176,
                531,
                262,
                581
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这些突变不显著降低亲和力，但大幅改变抗原表位，躲开中和抗体。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                585,
                668,
                601
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "chart",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/2568e09fdd035d76f86b755295e630c2398bb316fab6763df4637a8241084517.jpg"
                },
                "content": "Single mutation effects measured in Wuhan-Hu-1 and Single mutation effects measured in Beta.\n| Mutations ordered by effect on affinity | Wuhan-Hu-1 (Δlog₁₀(KD)) | Measured Omicron affinity (Δlog₁₀(KD)) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| N501Y | 0.0 | 0.0 |\n| S477N | 1.2 | 0.0 |\n| G339D | 1.8 | 0.0 |\n| T478K | 2.0 | 0.0 |\n| N440K | 2.1 | 0.0 |\n| S373P | 2.2 | 0.0 |\n| Q498R | 1.6 | 0.0 |\n| E484A | 1.4 | 0.0 |\n| S371L | 1.2 | 0.0 |\n| Q493R | 0.8 | 0.0 |\n| G446S | -0.5 | 0.0 |\n| K417N | -1.0 | 0.0 |\n| G496S | -1.5 | 0.0 |\n| Y505H | -2.5 | 0.0 |\n| Measured Omicron affinity (left) vs. Measured Omicron affinity (right) (dashed red line).",
                "chart_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "B "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（B）奥密克戎 BA.1 突变的亲和力缓冲效应。每个图展示了在武汉-Hu-1（左）或 Beta（右）"
                    }
                ],
                "chart_footnote": []
            },
            "sub_type": "line",
            "bbox": [
                171,
                638,
