                870
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "RBD 中测得的奥密克戎 BA.1 每个单 RBD 替换对 ACE2 结合亲和力[Δlog10(Kd)]的单独效应的累积叠加。即使背景中的参考状态不同，突变效应也按标注方向计算；例如，Beta 背景中的 N501Y 效应与测得的 Y501N 突变效应符号相反。红线表示武汉-Hu-1 的亲和力，星号表示奥密克戎 BA.1 RBD 相对于武汉-Hu-1 的实际亲和力"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                85,
                850,
                156
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PPT5：四、免疫缺陷宿主：点突变的 “进化工厂”"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                178,
                529,
                193
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "综述里特别强调：免疫低下人群是病毒突变的重要来源。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                196,
                583,
                212
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "比如 HIV 共感染、长期使用免疫抑制剂的患者，病毒可以在体内持续存活数月，进化速率比普通感染快得多，积累大量突变。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                215,
                847,
                249
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这些人相当于病毒的体内进化温床，源源不断产生新突变，最终扩散到人群，形成新变异株。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                252,
                847,
                268
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PPT6：五、上位性效应：突变不是单打独斗"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                288,
                489,
                305
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "点突变还有一个高级玩法：上位性（epistasis）。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                307,
                512,
                323
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "意思是：一个突变的效果，依赖其他突变的背景。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                326,
                529,
                342
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "比如 Q493E 这个突变，在早期毒株里作用很小，但在 Omicron 背景下，能大幅增强免疫逃逸。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                344,
                847,
                378
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "多个突变组合起来，实现 1+1>2 的效果，这是 Omicron 如此成功的关键之一。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                382,
                761,
                398
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "chart",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/3a96fa1b0913ee7272407c5bcab06d09215fa6ea7ed66b1ab5ba0c1c8c98d2e4.jpg"
                },
                "content": "| Number mutations | Binding affinity (-log₁₀(KD)) |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Wuhan-Hu-1       | 8.5                           |\n| N501Y            | 9.8                           |\n| Q498R            | 8.2                           |\n| N501Y+Q498R      | 11.5                          |",
                "chart_caption": [],
                "chart_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（A）双突变循环图，展示 N501Y 与 Q498R 之"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "sub_type": "line",
            "bbox": [
                149,
                403,
                473,
                664
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "间的正上位相互作用。星号表示假设加性效应时预期的双突变结合亲和力"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                678,
                715,
                694
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "回到 PPT4，Omicron 这么多突变加起来，在原始株背景下亲和力会掉到很低，但在有 N501Y的 Beta 背景下就能维持正常亲和力，这就是上位性效应带来的 “亲和力缓冲”"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                715,
                850,
                750
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "PPT7：总结：点突变的核心地位"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                144,
                789,
                401,
                804
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "最后做个小结："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                808,
                263,
